 0994   0006    '----- inventory combine: which recipe do items s% (top) + c% (
                bottom) match? 0 = none.
 0994   0006    '----- 1: 18+28 -> 22 · 2: formula halves 11+24 -> unreadable 
                52 · 4: 52 + book 25 ->
 0994   0006    '----- complete formula 36 · 3: syringe 29 + drug 34 -> loaded
                 syringe 35
 0994   0006    SUB CombChk (s%, c%, r%)
 099F   0006            r% = 0
 099F   0006            IF (s% = 18 AND c% = 28) OR (s% = 28 AND c% = 18) THEN 
                r% = 1
 09E4   0006            IF (s% = 11 AND c% = 24) OR (s% = 24 AND c% = 11) THEN 
                r% = 2
