 0C50   0006    '----- keyboard/joystick navigation for the inventory screen. Z
                ones: 0 = item grid,
 0C50   0006    '----- 1 = tabs (left pane), 2 = bottom buttons. k$ = U/D/L/R m
                ove, E = activate.
